      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "You have a cannon, bullets, a press and armor, and the zombies are learning to fear you. Steam is done. The next gate is steel, and steel is a GregTech project: make it in your furnace setup, press it into plates, and the LV chapter opens.\n\nLV changes the game. The Hand Cannon gives way to magazine-fed pistols, a revolver, a scoped rifle and a shotgun; armor moves up to steel; and ammo becomes a production line with its own machine. All of it is on the next tab to the right of this one.\n\nHold four steel plates to finish the chapter. Use the loot bags to patch any gaps in your kit, and eat something.\n\n[note]You do not need to finish every quest here to open LV. The LV chapter opens from the pack\u0027s own tier quests.[/note]",
